    {
      "title": "Meta&#8217;s Muse AI can create custom &#8216;spaces&#8217; for the version of the app you need right now",
      "link": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/1028871/meta-muse-ai-spaces",
      "description": "Meta will now allow you to build customized, app-like experiences within Muse. The new feature, called \"spaces,\" allows its AI assistant to build things like a shopping hub, school dashboard, music tracker, trivia game, and more, which you can interact with directly in the Muse app. Meta says you can create a new space by [&#8230;]",
